<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-MARTINEZ THIRD SPANIARD IN LAST 16.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARTINEZ THIRD SPANIARD IN LAST 16.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third seed Conchita Martinez brushed past Sweden's Asa Carlsson on Friday to earn a place in the fourth round of the Australian Open.</p>
<p>Martinez, displaying the full power of her tennis armoury, took 47 minutes to achieve a 6-0 6-1 win and a tie against 16th seed Sabine Appelmans of Belgium.</p>
<p>Martinez became the third Spaniard through to the final 16 in the men's and women's singles, alongside Carlos Moya and Felix Mantilla.</p>
</text>
